{#
  The identity of qbittorrent's two Flux Jobs, INERT until qbittorrent's flip, as `job.yaml.j2`
  and `prefs.yaml.j2` beside it are.

  It is a ServiceAccount with no Role. Both Jobs read the WebUI and exec into no pod, so they
  need no grant, and their pods mount no token.
#}
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: ServiceAccount
metadata:
  name: qbittorrent-verify
  namespace: {{ k8s_namespace }}
automountServiceAccountToken: false
